{"type":"message","id":"6e9c9fd3","parentId":"500d5f41","timestamp":"2026-04-27T06:57:42.692Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[Mon 2026-04-27 14:57 GMT+8] [Subagent Context] You are running as a subagent (depth 1/1). Results auto-announce to your requester; do not busy-poll for status.\n\n[Subagent Task]: 你是 breakdown-aligner。请对下面这份第五版《斗破苍穹》第1批（第1-6章）剧情拆解进行严格质量检查，只输出 PASS 或 FAIL，并在 FAIL 时给出精炼问题清单与修改建议。重点检查：是否真正抓住主线冲突、钩子强度是否准确、是否有冗余铺垫、分集是否合理、是否符合漫剧快节奏改编。\n\n待检查草案：\n\n### 第 1 批（第 1-6 章）\n\n**批次概要**：萧炎先在全族面前彻底坐实“废柴”身份，又被一年后的成年礼逼到悬崖边，紧接着云岚宗携婚约登门，当众退婚、长老倒戈、施舍踩脸接连砸下，最终把他彻底逼出翻身雪耻的反击誓念。\n**核心冲突数**：3 个（⭐⭐⭐）\n**高强度钩子数**：4 个（10-8 分）\n**覆盖集数**：第 1 - 第 5 集\n\n- 【剧情1】场景：萧家测试广场与山崖夜谈，族人与同辈 对 萧炎 当众宣布他只剩斗之力三段并集体羞辱，随后萧战又告诉他一年后成年仪式若还不到七段，就会被踢出家族核心，萧炎从废柴耻辱直接跌入命运倒计时，情绪钩子：群体羞辱 + 倒计时危机（9 分），第 1 集，状态：未用\n- 【剧情2】场景：萧家大厅，云岚宗来客与纳兰嫣然 对 萧家 强势登门压场，萧炎当场得知这个高高在上的天才少女正是自己的未婚妻，而她此来并非结亲，情绪钩子：身份压迫 + 悬念埋线（6 分），第 2 集，状态：未用\n- 【剧情3】场景：萧家大厅，葛叶与纳兰嫣然 对 萧战 当众提出解除婚约，萧战暴怒欲出手却被长老压下，萧炎父子在满堂注视中被公开踩脸，情绪钩子：当众退婚 + 父子受辱（10 分），第 3 集，状态：未用\n- 【剧情4】场景：萧家大厅，聚气散、炼药师名头与入云岚宗前途 对 三位长老、族人和萧炎 接连抛出诱惑与施压，族中众人几乎瞬间倒向退婚一方，纳兰嫣然更以施舍姿态逼萧炎开价退婚，把家族背刺与个人踩脸合并推到极致，情绪钩子：利益背刺 + 施舍羞辱（9 分），第 4 集，状态：未用\n- 【剧情5】场景：萧家大厅，纳兰嫣然与满堂族人 对 萧炎 把他逼到再无退路，萧炎在极致羞辱中彻底定下翻身雪耻的反击誓念，拒绝施舍，也绝不再任人践踏尊严，情绪钩子：尊严反击 + 立誓雪耻（10 分），第 5 集，状态：未用"}],"timestamp":1777273062684}}
{"type":"message","id":"592f07ad","parentId":"6e9c9fd3","timestamp":"2026-04-27T06:57:54.506Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"**Evaluating script performance**\n\nI’m assessing the situation and I don’t need any tools to do it. I should determine if the script passes or fails based on certain criteria, like identifying issues and making suggestions. It seems like there might be a problem with pacing since one scene is stretched over four episodes, which could impact hook scoring. The main conflict could focus on the humiliation leading to a vow. The chapters seem slow, particularly with redundant setups in episodes 2-5.","thinkingSignature":"{\"id\":\"rs_0de7a7c36c73c8030169ef08e816a88191b8682a04453ede1c\",\"type\":\"reasoning\",\"encrypted_content\":\"gAAAAABp7wjrbs9XfZL9lvYQG-8FLhD6K_UafI6Fzt4x9r9PkfvpeCeuk6uJZ-vNxapP1lXz6UG_3W_RB1TOcSRHsDSOfQRaQOoqXVgt26IKR1nu0zipqpUT15NZPANEAcdSGPpco1TEWdVGuwSKcG2gP_n8TDUSal_Aco1FbWKEi5mZgpEKl1it8tt1MBpJHDX4nw9Cp9HY0BhDTnajZYpfI2EitWUnjFeX5IzbF9I_0ZMd9Pu1mruOPd65-qKvuQj6C0mzKQWStlC5OaNNwbnN-LT8Eh4furER3efHjsOhfIakv7u2xFHEXUd0zb4dMAAzDi-sgD3j6rJTnONrMwmx_iOzuqFR0szrnrEOrhDIjURGdDe1kV58vUz32ITKChPaq5DFxVK-nLAgSunvXaAZRdqtXRUvMGTPlMO8_H-MYlTApBE_LU1HYz9jbcoEfZgbKOPmbsyzHajCseBjqsaUQsiLw0gDNe6_UJD8FZc1iu7lv0io_Du3bYFQAIiZquOVxookXCsi2BjrWVPYoXyu46xo19Fu9MXRIv3XUunUDFMBrKHudUmczR6m7EsPziziAfy3kA2jEqKy6IkhIJcOT7Kq_W78VKJf9pv3VpEWw_i-ie_N9UmsLiKqqSRizQPnzHA6JK0ApcO-GZ0Hrh8GXbQXROXSocMSwZdF-8PjgZIwVKeaR3mXZODGsgx2JL0AB52svHoW2oKyAbA5mVci2GR2KKXX695JZkd2uGVC8awbt830JaSsZylrq7E7qvc3LqufHiUqSeQzb6VeUSjmy05KNtqVaw8GdZUEh3a7LVydbwCqTVS-dRsxdWfUNshjIkhiCSWpU-ieSzXG_7-qVKlqGIkBGfQNDLdGs6_jxRODIoXV-AfGvkdd2Mu97e813k2kjhbHI_v2JuYQ5baqhWbae7Ke1-tm7qFgYTLy8Vv2lXQgJrNWQMdbWv-IWVhOxUlJDavROECUn6Q0wwkWODUdUUI0SJhZR1AttdlGReZD8AyJXb6zWce4QUSGh5AylS0zmDf1PQydVKp_E62GJ3miVdFb2fcOBmn6UAJans9xZk3q5R5N257RHvYUJqHkI2gFk0byK4PbC4etZ-GYGI9_cMtYU4tPkRVwUCkN-PNMYnG_JTdkk704xyefdcMR4e9U6p-2h3a0a-WsE_PNAgr0x19Jt1qltoZ8uZEJ5_bsJDNOFuco664o6cp_oHE_eCW9fQxpijqu7t_96JYWV4RxlF_Ce8rzai2aMfkOG5YxAUWf5Apg6J1nCuEDllw73j1KqZpGoQUZBgNzKnbho0O0H6UXJBSTQ4OSmV7NVXK3i25ztjqljkZEECbWN9zsiCaMBaP_urZieQF9X-SfSYhdyYFIDt67-bQ5_QYTwuQ-27MoeFIREDVLTEASHa9jeGzuD8Q9ptop8gh9ZpcLea11xUwkR3PsBz5fRezXbJTaWnATudeB1kNppVT3-j74hYW7R7oJ\",\"summary\":[{\"type\":\"summary_text\",\"text\":\"**Evaluating script performance**\\n\\nI’m assessing the situation and I don’t need any tools to do it. I should determine if the script passes or fails based on certain criteria, like identifying issues and making suggestions. It seems like there might be a problem with pacing since one scene is stretched over four episodes, which could impact hook scoring. The main conflict could focus on the humiliation leading to a vow. The chapters seem slow, particularly with redundant setups in episodes 2-5.\"}]}"},{"type":"text","text":"FAIL\n\n问题清单：\n1. 主线冲突抓得不够准。真正主线不是“3个并列冲突”，而是“废柴处境 + 退婚羞辱”共同把萧炎逼到立誓反击，核心矛盾应更集中，当前被拆散了。\n2. 分集明显过散。第2到第5集几乎都发生在萧家大厅同一轮退婚事件里，信息推进不足，撑成4集会拖慢节奏，不符合漫剧快节奏改编。\n3. 钩子强度标注偏虚高。第2条只是来客压场和未婚妻揭晓，悬念成立，但远不到强钩子；第4、第5也有情绪递进重复，不能都按高爆点处理。\n4. 存在冗余铺垫。退婚、长老倒戈、施舍羞辱、立誓反击本是连续升级链条，当前拆成多段后有“同一羞辱反复描述”的冗余感。\n5. 覆盖章回与集数性价比失衡。第1-6章只做5集，爆点密度偏低，容易显得一批内容只围着一场大厅戏打转。\n\n修改建议：\n1. 把核心冲突重述为“废柴身份坐实后，又遭退婚羞辱，尊严被逼到极限”，不要平均分成3个并列冲突。\n2. 合并大厅戏，建议压成2到3集完成：来客压场+退婚提出；长老倒戈+施舍羞辱；萧炎反击立誓。\n3. 下调钩子评分，只有“当众退婚”“立誓雪耻”可算顶级钩子，其余按中强度处理更准。\n4. 每集都要有明确新信息或关系逆转，避免只是同一场羞辱换说法。\n5. 若坚持5集结构，就必须补足每集独立爆点，否则建议直接缩编。","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_0de7a7c36c73c8030169ef08eb3a4c81918a7ca3e028f3e23d\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":10127,"output":574,"cacheRead":1536,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":12237,"cost":{"input":0.025317500000000003,"output":0.00861,"cacheRead":0.000384,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.0343115}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1777273062692,"responseId":"resp_0de7a7c36c73c8030169ef08e75d78819197ded09fd95614e8"}}
